OL,3,GNEWSAAirport warns passengers ahead of
OL,4,Abusy weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers travelling through
OL,7,FManchester Airport over the August bank
OL,8,Fholiday weekend have been warned to
OL,9,Fcheck how they pack to help reduce
OL,10,Fdelays during one of the busiest
OL,11,Fweekends in the airport's history.
OL,13,FThe Civil Aviation Authority (CAA) has
OL,14,Furged travellers to avoid packing
OL,15,Fbattery-powered devices in hold luggage
OL,16,Fas they pose a fire risk.
OL,18,FIt said bags may have to be offloaded
OL,19,Fif items such as vapes and power banks
OL,20,Fare found in them.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
