OL,3,GNEWSAAirport warns passengers ahead of
OL,4,Abusy weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout two million passengers are
OL,7,Fexpected to depart from airports across
OL,8,FGreat Britain during the weekend,
OL,9,Faccording to the regulator.
